        "func": "let data = msg.payload;\n\nlet id = data.ele_id;\nlet dens = data.density;\nlet mois = data.moisture;\nlet thick1 = data.thickness1;\n\nlet sql = `\nINSERT INTO electrode (electrode_id, moisture, thickness, density)\nVALUES(?, ?, ?, ?)\nON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE\n    moisture = VALUES(moisture),\n    thickness = VALUES(thickness),\n    density = VALUES(density);\n`;\n\nmsg.topic = sql;\nmsg.payload = [id, mois, thick1, dens];\n\nreturn msg;\n",
